  "$comment": "contract.ts additionally enforces markup-free plain text, email and phone formats on the nullable inquiry atoms, and that a null appears only on an x-atom string leaf or in the x-optional reviews slot. x-mock item groups are illustrative sample data: render.ts shows the fixed template caption (SAMPLE_DATA_CAPTION in slots.ts, not a recipe field) before every one of them.",
